  "question": {
    "text": "Bag<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo> </mo><mi>A</mi></math> contains <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> white, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math> red balls and bag <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> contains <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> white, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> red balls. One bag is selected at random and a ball is drawn from it. The probability of drawing the ball from the bag <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>, if the ball drawn in white, is :",
