  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given: Given balls in bags are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>W</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>7</mn><mi>R</mi></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>W</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi></math></p><p>Let, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mi>A</mi></math> is selected</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/79ddbbb7-6d97-4e5f-a908-87ba0a29098b.png\" style=\"width: 169px; height: 95px;\"/></p><p>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mi>B</mi></math> is selected</p><p>and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></math>: white ball is drawn</p><p>Using Baye's theorem,<br/><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>E</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>)</mo><mo>·</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>·</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>·</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>E</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>E</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>E</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>E</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>",
